    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i've tried that. but even acknowledging it doesn't change the fact that i'm just... finished. like a sunset that's already passed its peak. if the world has already moved on, maybe there's a kind of dignity in just letting go instead of forcing myself to stay in a place where i don't fit? it just feels so heavy to carry all this emptiness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
